[00:14.290]We’re not in love
{"我们并非相爱"}
[00:17.140]We share no stories
{"没有故事可分享"}
[00:19.980]Just something in your eyes
{"只是你眼中的某种光芒"}
[00:25.680]Don’t be afraid
{"不必害怕"}
[00:28.420]The shadows know me
{"阴影都熟悉我"}
[00:31.280]Let’s leave the world behind
{"让我们抛下整个世界"}
[00:36.720]Take me through the night
{"带我穿越黑夜"}
[00:39.200]Fall into the dark side
{"坠入黑暗面"}
[00:43.170]We don’t need the light
{"我们不需要光"}
[00:44.730]We’ll live on the dark side
{"我们将活在黑暗里"}
[00:48.580]I see it
{"我看见了"}
[00:49.860]Let’s feel it
{"让我们感受它"}
[00:51.210]While we’re still young and fearless
{"趁我们还年轻无畏"}
[00:53.760]Let go of the light
{"放开那束光"}
[00:56.020]Fall into the dark side
{"坠入黑暗面"}
[01:02.170]Fall into the dark side
{"坠入黑暗面"}
[01:07.930]Give in to the dark side
{"向黑暗面屈服"}
[01:16.370]Let go of the light
{"放开那束光"}
[01:18.510]Fall into the dark side
{"坠入黑暗面"}
[01:22.530]Beneath the sky
{"在苍穹之下"}
[01:24.790]As black as diamonds
{"如黑钻般漆黑"}
[01:27.650]We’re running out of time
{"我们时间所剩无几"}
[01:33.300]Don’t wait for truth
{"别等待真相"}
[01:36.170]To come and blind us
{"来蒙蔽双眼"}
[01:38.990]Let’s just believe their lies
{"就相信他们的谎言吧"}
[01:44.850]Believe it, I see it
{"相信吧 我已亲眼见证"}
[01:47.460]I know that you can feel it
{"我知道你也能感知"}
[01:50.290]No secrets worth keeping
{"没有值得保守的秘密"}
[01:53.130]So fool me like I’m dreaming
{"所以像梦一样欺骗我吧"}
